---
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const path = '/terms-and-conditions/';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<ContentPage
  title="Website Terms & Conditions | Priceline Pharmacy Pacific Fair"
  description="The terms and conditions that apply when you use the Priceline Pharmacy Pacific Fair website, including copyright, links and the limits of health information."
  path={path}
  h1="Terms and conditions"
  lead="Please read these terms before using this website. By using the site you agree to them."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Terms and conditions', href: path }]}
  dateModified="2026-10-07"
>
  <p>This website is operated by {site.legalName}, trading as {site.name}, an independently owned Priceline Pharmacy franchise store at {site.address.oneLine}. In these terms “we”, “us” and “our” refer to {site.name}.</p>

  <h2>Health information is general</h2>
  <p>The health information on this site is general in nature and is provided for education only. It is not medical advice, it does not take your personal circumstances into account, and it is not a substitute for a consultation with a pharmacist, doctor or other health professional. Always read the label and follow the directions for use of any medicine. If symptoms persist, or you are worried, see your pharmacist or doctor. In an emergency, call 000.</p>
  <p>Our articles are written by our team and reviewed by a registered pharmacist. We update them periodically, but health advice changes, so always check the “reviewed” date and confirm anything important with us in store.</p>

  <h2>Prices, services and availability</h2>
  <p>Prices, eligibility criteria, opening hours and services described on this site are correct to the best of our knowledge at the date shown on each page, but may change without notice. Government-funded programs (for example the National Immunisation Program and the PBS) have eligibility rules set by the Australian Government, and we will confirm your eligibility in store. Prescription medicines are supplied only on a valid Australian prescription and at the pharmacist’s professional discretion.</p>

  <h2>Copyright and trade marks</h2>
  <p>Unless stated otherwise, the text, images and design of this site are owned by or licensed to {site.legalName} and are protected by Australian copyright law. You may view, download and print pages for your personal, non-commercial use. You may not otherwise reproduce, publish or adapt any part of the site without our written permission. “Priceline” and the Priceline Pharmacy logo are trade marks of their owner and are used under franchise.</p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>This site links to third-party websites, including booking systems, Uber Eats, priceline.com.au, Help Medical and government health sites. We provide these links for convenience only. We do not control those sites, are not responsible for their content or privacy practices, and a link does not mean we endorse them.</p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>We take care to keep this site accurate and available, but we do not guarantee that it will be error-free or uninterrupted. To the extent permitted by law, including the Australian Consumer Law, we exclude liability for any loss arising from your use of, or reliance on, this site or anything linked from it. Nothing in these terms excludes rights you have under the Australian Consumer Law that cannot be excluded.</p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>Our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> explains how we handle personal and health information in store and on this website.</p>

  <h2>Changes and governing law</h2>
  <p>We may change these terms at any time by updating this page. These terms are governed by the laws of Queensland, Australia, and you submit to the non-exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Queensland.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${site.emailGeneral}`}>{site.emailGeneral}</a> or <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</p>
  <p>© {year} {site.legalName}. All rights reserved.</p>
</ContentPage>
